ts/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134702766,imgsize-175767.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Why 60% enriched fuel?' Vance demands Iran cut nuclear capacity to end war]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134755755.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US vice president JD Vance emphasized that Iran needs to make significant reductions in enrichment capacity. Vance highlighted the necessity of actionable commitments rather than mere promises for negotiations. The US is uncertain about Iran's internal decision-making process, especially after recent significant events. As the conflict continues, it poses political challenges for the Trump administration ahead of the midterm elections.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/why-60-enriched-fuel-vance-demands-iran-cut-nuclear-capacity-to-end-war/articleshow/134755755.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/why-60-enriched-fuel-vance-demands-iran-cut-nuclear-capacity-to-end-war/articleshow/134755755.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-07T09:55:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134755799,imgsize-64876.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Come to your senses': What is Pak PM's condition for talks with Imran's party]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134755090.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/come-to-your-senses-what-is-pakistan-pm-shehbaz-sharifs-condition-for-talks-with-imrans-party/articleshow/134755090.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatime